,"GeForce GTX 630 / Radeon HD 6570"],["DirectX","Version 11"],["Storage","3 GB available space"]],"rec":[],"deck":3,"blurb":"The Land Beneath Us is a turn-based roguelite dungeon crawler set in Annwn, the underworld of Welsh myth. Each run sends you down through floors of enemies, and you work your way toward seven powerful lords while gathering upgrades called Soul-Tech and swapping between a range of weapons. Every move you make lets enemies move too, so positioning and chaining skill combos are the heart of the combat.\n\nAlthough it is turn-based, it moves quickly, with short decisions rather than long pauses, so runs feel brisk. It is a single-player game, and since each run changes, it rewards replaying and experimenting with builds. It suits players who like tactical puzzles in combat and the steady progress of a roguelite."}}